  "transcript": {
    "status": "measured",
    "model": "whisper-1",
    "text": "This regression model sales from ad spend, store size, and region. The seeded case study has 120 stores. R-squared is 65.63%, and the F-test is below 0.0001. Technical adds the standard error, the t-statistic, and the 95% interval. Ad spend reads 1.76, with an interval from 1.51 to 2.01. Raising ad spend to the top of its slider moves predicted sales from 116.37 to 169.67. These residual plots use this fit. Residuals against fitted values show what the line leaves behind. The normal Q-Q plot compares that shape with a straight line. Cook's distance, as this screen calculates it, stays under the 0.5 line. Three rows are flagged by standardized residuals above 2. Re-fitting without those flagged rows changes the fit. R-squared moves from 0.6563 to 0.6930, and the sample falls from 120 to 117. Thank you for watching. See the fit. Read the uncertainty.",
    "segments": [
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 11,
        "text": " This regression model sales from ad spend, store size, and region."
      },
      {
        "start": 11,
        "end": 23,
        "text": " The seeded case study has 120 stores. R-squared is 65.63%, and the F-test is below 0.0001."
      },
      {
        "start": 23,
        "end": 32,
        "text": " Technical adds the standard error, the t-statistic, and the 95% interval."
      },
      {
        "start": 32,
        "end": 39,
        "text": " Ad spend reads 1.76, with an interval from 1.51 to 2.01."
      },
      {
        "start": 39,
        "end": 51,
        "text": " Raising ad spend to the top of its slider moves predicted sales from 116.37 to 169.67."
      },
      {
        "start": 51,
        "end": 65,
        "text": " These residual plots use this fit. Residuals against fitted values show what the line leaves behind."
      },
      {
        "start": 65,
        "end": 75,
        "text": " The normal Q-Q plot compares that shape with a straight line."
      },
      {
        "start": 75,
        "end": 82,
        "text": " Cook's distance, as this screen calculates it, stays under the 0.5 line."
      },
      {
        "start": 82,
