        "text": " Three rows are flagged by standardized residuals above 2."
      },
      {
        "start": 88,
        "end": 92,
        "text": " Re-fitting without those flagged rows changes the fit."
      },
      {
        "start": 92,
        "end": 103,
        "text": " R-squared moves from 0.6563 to 0.6930, and the sample falls from 120 to 117."
      },
      {
        "start": 103,
